 ['Should this version feel quiet or lively?','The daytime café should feel quiet, but the evening event needs more energy.','I suggest a quieter serif headline for the daytime café and a stronger sans-serif headline for the evening event. We can keep the body text consistent. Shall I show you both?','A small museum needs a poster for a lively family event. The main heading should feel welcoming and energetic; the access details must stay readable. Explain a pairing choice.','I would use a bold, simple headline to give the event more energy and a clear body font for the access details. Could you show me an example of the tone you prefer?'],
