 ['Do you need a revision of this poster or a separate language version?','A second-language version. We have used both included rounds and did not budget for this extra version.','A second-language version is an additional deliverable. I can quote for it and confirm the timing before I begin. Would you like a simpler option within the current budget?','A client agreed to one brochure but now requests a separate flyer. The client calls it “just a small change”. Clarify the new deliverable and offer an agreed next step.','I can create the flyer, but it is an additional deliverable rather than a revision of the brochure. Shall I send the fee and delivery date before I start?'],
